# an upgrade (1.3.0): a piece never changed takes today's recipe; one you changed keeps your settings.
# tests/host/proj-1.2.0*.bin are 1.2.0's own saves (made by its project code: every piece its 1.2.0 recipe; the second
# with Basic's Stabs set by hand to 77)
storefile tests/host/proj-1.2.0.bin
reboot
wait 500
expect format 21
expect piece 0
# Basic as 1.3.0 has it (Stabs 30, Feedback 62; 1.2.0's were 30 and 60), its noise Vinyl
expect par28 30
expect par11 62
expect par4 30
turn PRESET 3
wait 300
expect piece 3
# Fog too (its chord 50, its kick's Density 75)
expect par0 50
expect par116 75
turn PRESET -3
storefile tests/host/proj-1.2.0-basic-changed.bin
reboot
wait 500
# Basic changed by hand: kept as it was (its Stabs 77, its Feedback still 1.2.0's 60); Fog, untouched, today's
expect par28 77
expect par11 60
turn PRESET 3
wait 300
expect par0 50
# a 1.3.0 test build's save (format 14, every piece its recipe then), and the same converted and saved again as 15
# (its first values that build's recipe, the new ones today's): today's recipe either way
storefile tests/host/proj-1.3.0-test14.bin
reboot
wait 500
expect format 21
expect par11 62
expect par29 8
storefile tests/host/proj-1.3.0-test14-resaved15.bin
reboot
wait 500
expect par11 62
expect par29 8
# (1.4.0) a 1.4.0 test build's save (format 18, tests/host/proj-1.4.0-test18.bin: every piece its recipe then, as the
# user's FM-1 holds them): today's recipe, the LFOs' rates with it (Basic's 4 bars; Fog's chord its drift, 45, the wave off),
# the noise's LFO as the recipe has it (25: not converted, as a changed piece's would be)
storefile tests/host/proj-1.4.0-test18.bin
reboot
wait 500
expect format 21
expect piece 0
expect par125 25
expect par127 2
expect par128 2
turn PRESET 3
wait 300
expect piece 3
expect par55 0
expect par127 2
expect par128 2
expect par131 45
# (1.4.0, the user's: the Chord's pages) a 1.4.0 LFO pages save (format 20, as the user's FM-1 holds it): a piece
# changed kept as it is (Fog's Change, 16 bars), the chord's Vary and its LFO's Destination from
# the recipe (50, Cutoff); one never changed (Basic), today's recipe
expect par134 0
tap ENV
wait 300
spin K3 -2
wait 300
expect par6 3
store20
reboot
wait 500
expect format 21
expect piece 3
expect par6 3
expect par133 50
expect par134 0
turn PRESET -3
wait 300
expect piece 0
expect par133 50
expect par6 5
